  {
   "label": "before-resume session 2",
   "session": "c3519c11-d14e-42cf-9c59-84993bca1cbd",
   "voice_on_to_first_speech_start_ms": 1244.1,
   "turns": [
    {
     "phrase": "Do you know of any way to increase the speed of the conversation? || I would like it a little bit faster if possible.",
     "speech_end_to": {
      "endpoint_seen": -2551.3,
      "words_provisional_after": -2551.3,
      "committed_seen": -1415.2,
      "owner_message_canonical": -1402.1,
      "answered_seen": 11887.3,
      "answer_read_via_answered": 11895.5,
      "turn_appended": 38693.0,
      "answer_read_via_turn": 38704.5,
      "first_playback_start": 10609.9
     },
     "segments": [
      {
       "index": 1,
       "chars": 95,
       "text": "My lord, the pace of our exchange is governed by the local system that hosts this conversation.",
       "message_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 5.76,
       "arrived_ms": 10609.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 10609.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": null,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 28094.6,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 1285.6
      },
      {
       "index": 1,
       "chars": 99,
       "text": "My lord, the pace of our exchange is set by the hardware and software that hosts this conversation.",
       "message_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 5.84,
       "arrived_ms": 49673.2,
       "playback_start_ms": 82849.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 33176.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 66480.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -44145.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 2,
       "chars": 109,
       "text": "The steps you can influence are limited to what occurs before your words reach me and after I begin speaking.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 6.16,
       "arrived_ms": 13796.2,
       "playback_start_ms": 16369.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 2573.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -72320.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 22334.6,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 2,
       "chars": 159,
       "text": "The measured interval from when you finish speaking to when I begin voicing my first words is about six to thirteen seconds, as the house\u2019s own test runs show.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 8.56,
       "arrived_ms": 54470.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 88689.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 34219.1,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 66160.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -49985.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 3,
       "chars": 98,
       "text": "1. **Reduce the length of spoken input** \u2013 each additional syllable adds to the recognition stage.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 6.32,
       "arrived_ms": 16568.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 22529.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 5961.1,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -74720.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 16174.6,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 3,
       "chars": 139,
       "text": "I cannot promise a reduction nor can I guarantee that the path will remain unchanged if the house\u2019s firmware or the local model is altered.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 7.28,
       "arrived_ms": 57484.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 97249.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 39765.1,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 68400.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -58545.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 4,
       "chars": 98,
       "text": "A concise, focused question will shorten the interval between your pause and my first spoken word.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 5.6,
       "arrived_ms": 19071.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 28849.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 9778.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -75680.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 9854.6,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 4,
       "chars": 72,
       "text": "If you wish to see a modest improvement, consider these practical steps:",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 3.92,
       "arrived_ms": 59485.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 104529.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 45044.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 70080.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -65825.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 5,
       "chars": 199,
       "text": "2. **Avoid complex, multi\u2011step queries** \u2013 a single request that can be answered in one paragraph is processed faster than one that requires several layers of inference or reference to external data.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 11.44,
       "arrived_ms": 23375.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 34449.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 11074.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -74000.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 4254.6,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 5,
       "chars": 112,
       "text": "1. **Keep your spoken question concise** \u2013 each additional syllable adds to the recogniser\u2019s confirmation stage.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 6.56,
       "arrived_ms": 62247.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 108449.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 46203.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 62560.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -69745.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 6,
       "chars": 140,
       "text": "3. **Pre\u2011prepare text** \u2013 if you can type a brief, well\u2011formed question rather than speaking it, the recognition stage is bypassed entirely.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 8.96,
       "arrived_ms": 26920.3,
       "playback_start_ms": 45889.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 18969.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -69120.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -7185.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 6,
       "chars": 99,
       "text": "A focused, single\u2011sentence query will reach me faster than one that unfurls across several clauses.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 6.32,
       "arrived_ms": 65005.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 115009.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 50004.1,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 60160.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -76305.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 7,
       "chars": 63,
       "text": "The system will then jump straight to reasoning and generation.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 3.36,
       "arrived_ms": 28745.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 54849.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 26105.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -66480.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -16145.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 7,
       "chars": 189,
       "text": "2. **Avoid multi\u2011layered requests** \u2013 a single, clear answer is processed more quickly than a chain of interdependent sub\u2011questions that require the model to hold several threads in memory.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 11.28,
       "arrived_ms": 69216.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 121329.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 52113.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 63120.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -82625.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 8,
       "chars": 157,
       "text": "4. **Use the device\u2019s microphone with minimal background noise** \u2013 clearer audio reduces the time the recogniser spends confirming that a sentence has ended.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 9.28,
       "arrived_ms": 32355.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 58209.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 25855.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -74400.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -19505.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 8,
       "chars": 119,
       "text": "3. **Pre\u2011type when possible** \u2013 typing bypasses the speech\u2011to\u2011text stage entirely, eliminating that confirmation pause.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 8.08,
       "arrived_ms": 72491.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 132609.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 60118.9,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 65120.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -93905.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 9,
       "chars": 142,
       "text": "I cannot modify the underlying software or hardware, nor can I change the duration of the stages that have already been measured by the house.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 6.88,
       "arrived_ms": 35181.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 67489.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 32309.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -73200.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -28785.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 9,
       "chars": 120,
       "text": "4. **Minimise background noise** \u2013 a clean audio channel lets the recogniser finish earlier, shortening the first pause.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 7.76,
       "arrived_ms": 75658.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 140689.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 65031.4,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 66320.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -101985.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 10,
       "chars": 170,
       "text": "Should you wish to explore a different configuration, the relevant system parameters would need to be adjusted by those who maintain the house\u2019s technical infrastructure.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-604b-72f7-8fbf-6a6526303076",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 8.48,
       "arrived_ms": 38560.2,
       "playback_start_ms": 74369.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 35809.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": -74080.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -35665.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 10,
       "chars": 155,
       "text": "5. **Use the house\u2019s maintenance tools** \u2013 if the house\u2019s firmware is updated or the local model is re\u2011trained, the overall response path may be shortened.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 8.96,
       "arrived_ms": 79199.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 148449.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 69251.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 65600.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -109745.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 11,
       "chars": 97,
       "text": "That work lies outside my remit; it is for those who manage the house\u2019s technical infrastructure.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 5.84,
       "arrived_ms": 81781.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 157409.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 75628.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -118705.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 12,
       "chars": 151,
       "text": "I remain at your service, and should you wish to discuss a specific change that might be undertaken by the house\u2019s engineers, I can relay your request.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 7.6,
       "arrived_ms": 84965.5,
       "playback_start_ms": 163249.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 78284.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -124545.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 13,
       "chars": 66,
       "text": "Otherwise, these are the only adjustments I can advise at present.",
       "message_id": "01a0dc20-ff94-7d61-a8d3-65977a76dbee",
       "pieces": 1,
       "underrun_ms": 0.0,
       "duration_s": 3.68,
       "arrived_ms": 86852.7,
       "playback_start_ms": 170849.9,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 83997.2,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -132145.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      }
     ]
